        "timestamp": 1774607319,
        "contenuto_esteso": "Israel's secret services have launched a campaign calling on the Iranian people to contact them and provide any information they may have about the Revolutionary Guards and the regime’s leaders. However, those who speak out risk punishment – even death. Our colleagues at France 2 take a look at what tactics Israel is employing and its overall motives."
